The files in this repository's releases are LCM Nav3D Samples: demo levels and their art for LCM Nav3D. They are
licensed only to holders of an LCM Nav3D license, for use in projects that use LCM Nav3D, under the LCM Nav3D EULA
(EULA.txt in the LCM Nav3D plugin, where they are its "sample content" and "demonstration levels"). They may not be
redistributed, resold, or used apart from LCM Nav3D. They install only through LCM Nav3D (LCM Nav3D menu > Get the
Demo Levels).
